SUMMARY:3rd All India Conference of East Asian Studies
LOCATION:Conference Room I\, IIC main\, India International Centre\, 40 M
 ax Mueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/3rd-all-india-conference-east-asian-st
 udies
DESCRIPTION:3rd All India Conference of East Asian Studies\nKeynote Addre
 ss by Prof. Kan Kimura\, Graduate School of International Cooperation Stu
 dies\, Kobe University\nFollowed by Thematic discussions and a Special Le
 cture by eminent academicians\, policy experts and researchers on contemp
 orary issues in East Asian Studies\, international politics\, regional se
 curity\, technology\, economics and the environment.\nThe conference will
  examine the evolving geopolitical\, economic and strategic landscape of 
 East Asia and the Indo-Pacific\, with a particular focus on Japan's role 
 in shaping a free\, open and rules-based regional order. Discussions will
  explore regional security\, economic resilience\, technology\, climate a
 nd multilateral cooperation.\n(Collaboration: Institute of Chinese Studie
 s and Japan Foundation)\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in/programmes/3rd-all-india-c
 onference-east-asian-studies
CATEGORIES:talk\,sociology
END:VEVENT
