SUMMARY:Integration-the game changer in reversing chronic diseases
LOCATION:Conference Room I\, IIC main\, India International Centre\, 40 M
 ax Mueller Marg\, Lodhi Gardens\, New Delhi 110003
URL:https://iicdelhi.in/programmes/integration-game-changer-reversing-chr
 onic-diseases
DESCRIPTION:Integration-the game changer in reversing chronic diseases\nS
 peaker: Dr Vijay Mohan Kohli\,MS MCh FIACS\, Senior Consultant Cardiac Su
 rgeon\, Pushpawati Singhania Research Institute\, Saket New Delhi.\nChair
 : Prof. Yogendra Kumar Gupta\, pharmacologist\, President of AIIMS Kalyan
 i\, West Bengal\, and Chairman of the Review Committee on Genetic Manipul
 ation (RCGM).\nThe principles\, modalities and benefits of Integrative Me
 dicine will be presented and examination on how an integrated approach to
  healthcare can play a transformative role in the prevention\, management
  and reversal of chronic diseases such as diabetes\, hypertension\, heart
  disease and arthritis.\n\nhttps://iicdelhi.in/programmes/integration-gam
 e-changer-reversing-chronic-diseases
