SUMMARY:Les Liaisons Dangereuses
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1347
DESCRIPTION:NT Live Broadcast . Les Liaisons Dangereuses (English/170 min
 s with interval) by Christopher Hampton . Dir. Marianne Elliott . Based o
 n the novel by Pierre Choderlos de Laclos . Cast: Lesley Manville\, Aidan
  Turner\, Monica Barbaro & others. Marquise de Merteuil is a master in th
 e art of survival. Alongside the magnetic Vicomte de Valmont\, they turn 
 seduction into strategy and weaponise desire. But when their alliance col
 lapses into rivalry\, the battle between them threatens to destroy everyo
 ne in their path. Tickets at Rs.500\, Rs.350 & Rs.250 are available onlin
 e on bookmyshow.com and at the Habitat Programmes desk .\n\nhttps://india
 habitat.org/Events_details/1347
CATEGORIES:film\,cinema
END:VEVENT
