SUMMARY:Sargun se Nirgun: Kabir in Motion
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1352
DESCRIPTION:Sargun se Nirgun: Kabir in Motion. A Bharatanatyam performanc
 e by Bhadra Sinha and Gayathri Sharma \, exploring the philosophy of Sant
  Kabir as a journey from ignorance to awareness\, and from ritual to real
 ization. Rooted in Bhakti\, Kabir's verses transcend religion\, and throu
 gh expressive abhinaya\, rhythmic footwork\, and symbolic choreography\, 
 the performance highlights the enduring relevance of his teachings in mod
 ern life. Collab. Kalakriti Arts and Satyanjali Trust .\n\nhttps://indiah
 abitat.org/Events_details/1352
CATEGORIES:performance\,dance
END:VEVENT
