UID:579e3b601011d174@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260728T192425Z
DTSTART:20260821T133000Z
DTEND:20260821T153000Z
SUMMARY:Rashtra Yajna: Every Step in Service\, Every Beat for the Nation
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1354
DESCRIPTION:Rashtra Yajna: Every Step in Service\, Every Beat for the Nat
 ion . To Commemorate the 150th Anniversary of Vande Mataram . Woven with 
 the grace\, discipline and expressive power of Bharatanatyam\, the perfor
 mance transforms every movement into an offering of devotion and every rh
 ythmic beat into a tribute to the spirit of the Nation. Enriched by the i
 mmediacy and emotional depth of live musicians\, the production celebrate
 s India's invaluable cultural heritage\, orally transmitted for thousands
  of years\, now inscribed in the Memory of the World (MOW) by UNESCO\, th
 e sacrifices of its freedom fighters\, and the enduring ideals of beauty\
 , nature's bounty\, unity and nationalism. Presented by IHC in collaborat
 ion with Prathibha Prahlad & Prasiddha Repertory .\n\nhttps://indiahabita
 t.org/Events_details/1354
CATEGORIES:performance\,dance
END:VEVENT
