SUMMARY:चहुँमुखी... A Musical Efflorescence of Dhrupad\, 
 Khayal\, Thumri & Bhajan
LOCATION:The Theatre\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New Delhi 1100
 03
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1357
DESCRIPTION:चहुँमुखी... A Musical Efflorescence of Dhrupa
 d\, Khayal\, Thumri & Bhajan . Conceptualised & performed by Dr. Aditi Sh
 arma Garg . Chahunmukhi presents a commanding rendition of Dhrupad\, capt
 ures the vivid imaginative flair of Khayal Gayaki\, reflects the playful 
 nuances of Thumri\, and embodies the profound devotion of Bhakti Sangeet.
 \n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1357
CATEGORIES:performance\,music
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ec769161f576e5b1@delhi-events
DTSTAMP:20260728T192425Z
DTSTART:20260822T133000Z
DTEND:20260822T153000Z
SUMMARY:Dalla Ayaara
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1358
DESCRIPTION:Dalla Ayaara (Hindustani\, Urdu/40 mins) Performed by Meera R
 izvi & Usman Siddiqui . Followed by Dastan - e - Chhabeeli Bhatiyarin (Hi
 ndustani\, Urdu/50 mins) Performed by Meera Rizvi & Rana Pratap Sengar . 
 Adapted by Meera Rizvi . Dir. Mahmood Farooqui . Produced by Anusha Rizvi
  . Two hilarious qissas from the 19th century about wily women and their 
 stratagems. Dalla Ayaara is witty\, quick-thinking\, and charming\, and m
 anages to con anyone and everyone who crosses her path\, often with hilar
 ious results. Chhabeeli is a qissa where the story pits the other woman (
 Chhabeeli) and the Prince’s wife (Nachhattar) against each other in a c
 ontest of wits as they compete to win the affections of a rather entitled
  and silly Prince. Prod. Dastangoi Collective . Tickets at Rs.500\, Rs.35
 0 & Rs.200 are available online on bookmyshow.com and at the Habitat Prog
 rammes desk .\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1358
CATEGORIES:performance\,theatre
END:VEVENT
