SUMMARY:Hansika: An Adaptation of Swan Lake
LOCATION:The Stein Auditorium\, India Habitat Centre\, Lodhi Road\, New D
 elhi 110003
URL:https://indiahabitat.org/Events_details/1371
DESCRIPTION:Hansika: An Adaptation of Swan Lake (English/75 mins) Choreog
 raphed by Sharmila Mukerjee \, performed by her with the Sanjali Ensemble
 . Original Music Score & Direction by Praveen D Rao . Hansika is an adapt
 ation of Swan Lake\, the ballet composed by Pyotr Ilyich Tchaikovsky\, in
  the context of Indian classical dance–Odissi. Inspired by the story of
  Odette\, a princess turned into a swan by an evil sorcerer's curse\, the
  production explores the humane aspect of the plot through the Indian wor
 ld of raga\, taal\, laya and rasa. Prod. Sanjali Centre for Odissi Dance 
 . Tickets at Rs.500\, Rs.400 & Rs.250 are available online on bookmyshow.
 com and at the Habitat Programmes desk.\n\nhttps://indiahabitat.org/Event
 s_details/1371
CATEGORIES:performance\,dance
END:VEVENT
